# Multi-device sync is optional. Leave these unset and Notework runs
# local-only: no account, no network, everything in this browser.
#
# To turn sync on, create a Supabase project and paste its Project URL and
# anon (publishable) key here as .env.local, then run src/data/sync/schema.sql
# in the project's SQL editor. See README.md for the full walkthrough.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
